<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: France says budget pact covers all main points.</title>
<headline>France says budget pact covers all main points.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>France won agreement on all the main points it sought in the pact which EU leaders agreed today for enforcing budget discipline after economic and monetary union (EMU), President Jacques Chirac's spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Spokeswoman Catherine Colonna said that in particular, the accord gave ministers discretion to decide whether to levy fines on EMU member states which ran budget deficits of more than three percent.</p>
</text>
